From 3670dd0020af17bdea5cbea3465ff12064c20596 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: moWerk <mo@mowerk.net>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:53:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] software_isp: ipa: simple: af: Focus on AfWindows
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The software ISP maps the first AfWindows rectangle from pixel array to
input frame coordinates and moves the statistics' sharpness area there
(an empty list restores the default centre window). The Af algorithm
registers AfMode, AfMetering and AfWindows and restarts the scan when
the window changes, which gives tap to focus without an AfTrigger.

Disclosure: LLMGD-2 · origin O1 (author asked for tap to focus and ISO on the camera and tested both in jolla-camera, the model wrote the code)
